# The Zabbix agent manifest hashes the probe files byte-for-byte. Git must
# never rewrite their line endings: windows-latest checks out text files with
# CRLF by default, which changes every SHA-256 and makes
# `python scripts/build_agent_manifest.py --check` fail before the installer
# is even built. Treat PowerShell files as non-text so the committed bytes are
# the checked-out bytes on every platform.
*.ps1 -text
*.psm1 -text
